    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I Just Want to Be Happy.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/21080a037dff64963869eef306cf4648.avif?t=1743101922\" width=300 height=500 /></span><br><br>A game tributing old flash games and challenging precision platformers. A game to make me Happy. A game to make you Happy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/b837e982f04a12ea417294f9b5b7ee08.poster.avif?t=1743101922\" width=420 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/b837e982f04a12ea417294f9b5b7ee08.webm?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/b837e982f04a12ea417294f9b5b7ee08.mp4?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Happy comes home on his birthday to find that his family has been murdered. He must find the masked assailant and figure out what the heck just happened!<br>The adventure begins by running into the woods.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >early Access</h2></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/3e8fc80d8ba6655f4c591a5864662ee0.poster.avif?t=1743101922\" width=360 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/3e8fc80d8ba6655f4c591a5864662ee0.webm?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/3e8fc80d8ba6655f4c591a5864662ee0.mp4?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This early access version features the first world &quot;The Woods&quot; which contains<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> - 13 levels<br></li><li> - 3 boss battles<br></li><li> - 2 secret coins in every level<br></li><li> - Additional secrets and items to collect<br></li><li> - Customize your happy (Masks, Spraypaints, Misc.)<br></li><li> - Epic custom musical tracks<br></li><li> - Art from @JohnWowCool</li></ul><br><i>the Steam Game You Won't Want to Miss</i><br><strong>BE ON THE EDGE OF YOUR SEAT BEGGING FOR MORE</strong><br><u>SPEEDRUNNERS AND HARDCORE GAMERS THIS GAME IS FOR YOU</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/f564295339b29af1b3ba29a404e2382f.poster.avif?t=1743101922\" width=360 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/f564295339b29af1b3ba29a404e2382f.webm?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/f564295339b29af1b3ba29a404e2382f.mp4?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I Just Want to Be Happy.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/21080a037dff64963869eef306cf4648.avif?t=1743101922\" width=300 height=500 /></span><br><br>A game tributing old flash games and challenging precision platformers. A game to make me Happy. A game to make you Happy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/b837e982f04a12ea417294f9b5b7ee08.poster.avif?t=1743101922\" width=420 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/b837e982f04a12ea417294f9b5b7ee08.webm?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/b837e982f04a12ea417294f9b5b7ee08.mp4?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Happy comes home on his birthday to find that his family has been murdered. He must find the masked assailant and figure out what the heck just happened!<br>The adventure begins by running into the woods.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >early Access</h2></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/3e8fc80d8ba6655f4c591a5864662ee0.poster.avif?t=1743101922\" width=360 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/3e8fc80d8ba6655f4c591a5864662ee0.webm?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849190/extras/3e8fc80d8ba6655f4c591a5864662ee0.mp4?t=1743101922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This early access version features t